id: pm-github-5wzr
title: Regenerate the changelog after the release tag was created
description: "The daily release generated CHANGELOG.md before creating its release tag, leaving the committed Unreleased heading stale and causing changelog:check to fail on main and inherited pull requests. Regenerate the file with the tag present so the committed changelog matches deterministic generation."
