comments[1]{created_at,author,text,edited_at}:
  "2026-08-30T14:50:19.088Z",pi-agent,"Evidence: npm run changelog:full wrote CHANGELOG.md with the release tag present. npm run changelog:check reported: Changelog is up to date: CHANGELOG.md. The diff is limited to consolidating the stale Unreleased section under 2026.8.29 plus this item's tracking files.","2026-08-30T14:56:20.878Z"
close_reason: "Regenerated CHANGELOG.md with the v2026.08.29 tag present and verified changelog:check passes."
